{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの地元やねーん(o>ω<o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島帰って参りましたひめたんです♪\n久しぶりの広島、久しぶりの自宅、そして明日は久しぶりの学校。\n短い広島滞在期間おもいっきりリラックスして、パワー注入してきます('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/02/19/cimg0312.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おめが」て携帯で打ったら「ω」て出てきたーあ!\n今度から顔文字打つのが早くなりそう(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめが。おめが。ω。\n教えて下さった方ありがとうございましたー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第一回ハト顔文字選手権閉幕!\n参加してくださった選手のみなさまお疲れ様でございました。\n大会運営にご協力、ありがとうございました(^^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩んだ結果・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( °∞°) ＋ *       ノ ＝ (*°∞°)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*°∞°)ノくるっくー♪\n↑これ採用。ひめたんのブログにちょいちょい登場する予定です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺はななみんとベビたんの誕生日の前日が誕生日なので、\nひめたんに祝ってもらったら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます!\nいいなあ２人と近いのかあ(*^ω^*)♪\nステキな1年になりますように。\nお誕生日パーティとかしましたか？報告待ってます//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は何してたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徹夜で高校の課題\n→お昼寝(ｗ)♪\n→おじいちゃん家!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウチは猫屋敷です。今13匹います。そういうのって、どうですかね？ｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんいっぱいいるんですか=^・ω・^=!\nいーなあ楽しそう♪\n毎日楽しいですね。寂しくならないじゃーん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤由貴の卒業って歌知ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってますよ(^^)\n昔のひめたんみたいな歌詞。\nああ卒業式で泣かないとー冷たい人ーと言ーわーれーそう～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日からのスケジュールを教えてー出演情報とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいー♪\n＊ミタパンブー(月-木)23:35～23:45\n＊ミニ握手会\n・水→イオンモール広島府中　1Fスターギャラリー\n・木→イオンモール大日　1階サニーコート\n・土→イオンモール草津　1Fセントラルコート\n・日→イオンモール高岡　1Fセントラルコート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは公式サイトとひめたんカレンダーをチェックしてみて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か忘れてない？\nそう、2月のカレンダー。まってますよ。(^3^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んあーお待たせしましたひめたんカレンダー２月号どーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/02/19/dsc_0702_3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日だけ男子になれるなら何がしたい！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メンのファンとしてイベントに参加したい(o>ω<o)!\nいやおんなのこでも参加したいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうblogにひめたんのことが書かれていたね。\nダンスを踊るだけでも大変なのにアドリブを使っているって本当なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドリブを使ってるって意識はないんですよね。\nみゅみゅがそんなこと思ってくれてるなんて初めて知りました(*^^*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年に入ってから4日だけしか休んでいないのよ。ひめたん、頑張っている俺を応援して下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あら大変(・o・ノ)ノ!\n毎日お疲れ様ですっ。お仕事は楽しいですか？いや辛いですよねー...\nひめたんもお仕事頑張ります(^^)!一緒にお仕事楽しみましょーう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の全国握手って乃木坂全メンバー参加するものなのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ、全員参加の予定です(`・・)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島県以外のご当地アイドルグループで気になるグループっている？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島以外だと\n大阪のMary Angel(メアリーエンジェル)さん♪\n前に一緒にイベント出演したことがあって、\nずっと応援させてもらってます＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして、ひめたんもさばドルだったりしないよね？ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばりばりの15歳でございますっ(^ω^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんみたいに綺麗な髪の毛になりたいんですけど\nひめたんは髪の毛のケアはどんなことをしてますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイじゃないけれどもー...。\nどうだろう。最近「マシェリ」のシャンプー使ってるんだけど\nいい香りだし、ボトルも可愛いの(*^^*)\nシャンプー効果かなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩フルバージョンで初めて観た。途中みんなで泣いてたけど、\nあれはどうして泣いてたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはご想像におまかせします。\nいろんな想いが作品に込められているんです。乃木詩。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}